        "created_at": "2017-07-11T14:19:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I don't imagine too many people on these forums care about talking marshmallow ponies.</p><p>But on the off chance some of you do,&nbsp;<em>and</em> you'll be in the Columbus, OH area this weekend, I plan to be in the tabletop gaming room when I'm not elsewhere, teaching Sentinels to anyone who's interested. Nothing official, but I have hope. :B I actually introduced at least one person to the game last year by showing off the digital version. Maybe I'll get another this year!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
