        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-07-16T23:20:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Con was a success! :) Played Sentinels for like seven hours on Saturday, and three games today. Got one guy&nbsp;<em>extremely</em> hooked. Introduced a few others to it. Found out someone was playing it last year, and I can only ask,&nbsp;<em>where?</em> Made sure to advertise the digital version as much as I could. :V Even talked up Spirit Island a little despite never having played it! (That game is just too cool!) Cheers!</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
